<title>HONG KONG: M.Lynch sets warrants on Bk of East Asia.</title>
<headline>M.Lynch sets warrants on Bk of East Asia.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Tuesday it has launched 180 million American-style call warrants on shares of Bank of East Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$31.90	     PREMIUM	   12.48 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.3981	    GEARING	   8.01X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	12.NOV.97	    SETTLEMENT DAY  27.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	    MIN EXER LOT    2,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$31.90	     GOVERNING LAW   HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTES	     PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
